		{"id":"547284cc435ce88c","type":"text","text":"# Refinements on inference\n\n1. Enrichment of business_entity by removing be_name\n\t1. Pass sample values while inferring the metadata.\n\t2. De-duplications\n\t\t1. while inferring business_entity check whether the generated name is already present, if yes modify name accordingly.\n\n\n---\n\n1. replace spaces with underscore in business_entity\n2. Do not copy business_entity and label\n\t1. label should be as it is.\n3. rewrite table name in column_metadata.\n4. Replace be_name to business_entity variable in codebase.\n5. change ","x":-380,"y":-220,"width":780,"height":440,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f642b38d9e6d6473","type":"text","text":"### Old Version \n\n[IDENTITY] sample_gl_export_cleansed_Sheet1.meta_testing_115 | General Ledger Entries in FP&A | meta_testing_115 Finance | aka: gl_export, financial_transactions, ledger_data\n\n[ONTOLOGY] Entity: Financial Data | Parent: Chart of Accounts.account_number (1:M) | Children: N/A | Related: Trial Balance via validation | Domain: Finance | Role: master_data\n\n[SEMANTICS] Centralized repository for transaction-level financial data including account classifications and amounts | Purpose: support financial reporting, analysis, and decision-making | Rules: account_number must be unique; amount must be valid; date must be within reporting period | Dependencies: if account_type='asset' then amount must be >= 0 | Standards: N/A\n\n[TECHNICAL] table | Columns: 27 | PK: line_unique_key | FK: account_number→chart_of_accounts.account_number, department_id→departments.department_id | Indexes: idx_account_number, idx_date | Format: structured data\n\n---\n### New version\n\n[IDENTITY] sample_gl_export_cleansed_sheet1.test_919_09.source | General Ledger Sheet1 in Financial Planning & Analysis | FinancialDataSystem Finance | aka: GL, financial_data, ledger_data\n\n[ONTOLOGY] Entity: Financial Data | Parent: Chart of Accounts.account_number (1:M) | Children: Trial Balance.period, Financial Statements.entity | Related: Trial Balance via validates; Chart of Accounts via classifies | Domain: Finance | Role: master_data\n\n[SEMANTICS] Centralized source for financial data integrity and reporting | Purpose: support planning, budgeting, and forecasting | Rules: unique account requirement; valid entry references; balanced trial balance | Dependencies: if account_type='asset' then amount must be >= 0 | Standards: GAAP\n\n[TECHNICAL] table | Columns: 28 | PK: line_unique_key | FK: account_number→Chart of Accounts.account_number, subsidiary_id→subsidiaries.subsidiary_id | Indexes: idx_account_number, idx_period | Format: CSV","x":-680,"y":540,"width":670,"height":960,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"dc2def02be330f1e","type":"text","text":"### Old Version \n\n[IDENTITY] sample_tb_export_cleansed_Sheet1.meta_testing_115 | Financial Performance Data in FP&A | meta_testing_115 Finance | aka: tb_export, financial_performance_data\n\n[ONTOLOGY] Entity: Financial Data | Parent: Chart of Accounts.account_number (1:M) | Children: N/A | Related: General Ledger via event_id | Domain: Finance | Role: master_data\n\n[SEMANTICS] Centralized table for tracking financial performance metrics across subsidiaries, including historical data and calculated values | Purpose: support variance analysis, forecasting, and performance evaluation | Rules: account_number must be unique; subsidiary_id must exist in subsidiaries table; total debits must equal total credits | Dependencies: if event_id exists then corresponding financial activity must be recorded | Standards: N/A\n\n[TECHNICAL] master_data | Columns: 15 | PK: account_number | FK: subsidiary_id→subsidiaries.subsidiary_id, event_id→events.event_id | Indexes: idx_subsidiary_id, idx_event_id | Format: structured data\n\n---\n### New version\n\n[IDENTITY] sample_tb_export_cleansed_sheet1.test_919_09.source | Trial Balance Sheet1 in Financial Planning & Analysis | FinancialDataSystem Finance | aka: TB, trial_balance, financial_control\n\n[ONTOLOGY] Entity: Trial Balance | Parent: Chart of Accounts.account_number (1:M) | Children: General Ledger.transaction_date | Related: Financial Statements via General Ledger | Domain: Finance | Role: master_data\n\n[SEMANTICS] Centralized source for validating accounting integrity by ensuring total debits equal total credits | Purpose: support planning, budgeting, and forecasting | Rules: unique account requirement; valid entry references; balanced trial balance | Standards: GAAP\n\n[TECHNICAL] table | Columns: 15 | PK: event_id | FK: subsidiary_id→subsidiaries.subsidiary_id | Indexes: idx_account_number, idx_event_id | Format: CSV","x":40,"y":540,"width":660,"height":960,"color":"4"}
